# The three Learn lessons on a portrait phone (DPR 3), played by the content's solver with a finger (tools/gen-plays.mjs;
# generated: do not edit): jumps tap the right half of the course, form changes press the FORM button; Next stage leads
# from lesson to lesson, and the title then counts the lessons and the Tutorial Graduate achievement.
# viewport 390x844@3
until 300 Pulse Jumper
frames 30
save title
touch =Learn
frames 305
touch 75% 45%
frames 147
touch 75% 45%
until 900 STAGE CLEAR
frames 20
expect =650
expect =Time 8.8s · 2 jumps · 0 form changes
save lesson-1
touch =Next stage
frames 329
touch =Form (F or left tap)
until 900 STAGE CLEAR
frames 20
expect =650
expect =Time 10.0s · 0 jumps · 1 form changes
save lesson-2
touch =Next stage
frames 289
touch 75% 45%
frames 150
touch =Form (F or left tap)
frames 177
touch 75% 45%
until 900 STAGE CLEAR
frames 20
expect =725
expect =Time 12.2s · 2 jumps · 1 form changes
save lesson-3
touch =Title
until 60 Progress
frames 10
expect Lessons completed: 3/3.
expect Achievements unlocked: 1.
save title-after
